      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At this point, 'apply' receives a primitive procedure and the list of arguments (3 4).\nIt therefore matches the 'primitive-procedure?' clause, which delegates the computation\nto 'apply-primitive-procedure'. The underlying Scheme implementation applies + to the\narguments 3 and 4, producing the final result:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At this point, 'apply' receives a primitive procedure and the list of arguments (3 4).\nIt therefore matches the 'primitive-procedure?' clause, which delegates the computation\nto 'apply-primitive-procedure'. The underlying Scheme implementation applies + to the\narguments 3 and 4, producing the final result:",
